Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Delete
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|calendarResourceName|Calendar Resource Name|
	When CalendarResource add
		|calendarResourceName|${calendarResourceName}|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarResource delete
		|calendarResourceName|${calendarResourceName}|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	Then CalendarResource view Default
		|calendarResourceName|${calendarResourceName}|
Scenario: Search
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When CalendarResource add
		|calendarResourceName|Room 1|
	And CalendarResource add
		|calendarResourceName|Car1|
	And CalendarResource add
		|calendarResourceName|Truck|
	And CalendarResource search
		|calendarResourceName|Room Car |
	And CalendarResource view Resource Name
		|calendarResourceName|Room 1|
	And CalendarResource view Resource Name
		|calendarResourceName|Car1|
	And CalendarResource view Resource Name Not Present
		|calendarResourceName|Truck|
	And CalendarResource search
		|calendarResourceName|Room|
	And CalendarResource view Resource Name
		|calendarResourceName|Room 1|
	And CalendarResource view Resource Name Not Present
		|calendarResourceName|Car1|
	Then CalendarResource view Resource Name Not Present
		|calendarResourceName|Truck|
Scenario: View Event Date And Time In Resources Availability
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent goto Configure Invitations
	And CalendarEvent view Resources Availability
	And CalendarEvent compare Event Date And Time To Resources Availability Date And Time
	And CalendarEvent select Times
		|endDateTime|11:00 AM|
		|startDateTime|08:00 AM|
	And CalendarEvent compare Event Date And Time To Resources Availability Date And Time
	And CalendarEvent set End Date Tomorrow
	And CalendarEvent select Times
		|endDateTime|07:00 AM|
		|startDateTime|08:00 AM|
	And CalendarEvent compare Event Date And Time To Resources Availability Date And Time
	Then CalendarEvent publish
