Scenario: View Invited Resource Availability
Priority: 3
	Given TestCase get Site Name
##########################################################
The Poshi return element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|${siteName}|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Members
		|portlet|Site Memberships|
	And Site assign User As Member CP
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And Calendar add
		|calendarName|userfn userln|
		|calendarType|Other Calendars|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarResource add
		|calendarResourceName|Calendar Resource Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarResource view
		|calendarResourceName|Calendar Resource Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And Calendar add
		|calendarName|Calendar Resource Name|
		|calendarType|Other Calendars|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|calendarName|userfn userln|
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event All Day Title|
		|eventType|Regular|
		|optionSet|true|
		|optionSetValue|inviteResource|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|resourcesAvailability|true|
		|specificOptionSetValue|Test Test,Calendar Resource Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	Then CalendarEvent view
		|eventNumber|2|
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event All Day Title|

